cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the derived datasets, please cite both the software
  (this repository, via its Zenodo DOI) and the paper listed under
  preferred-citation.
title: >-
  Air quality estimation failure in scarcest monitoring networks: analysis
  pipeline
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and analysis code for a study of the transferability of
  satellite-to-surface NO2 inversion across 128 cities and four national
  monitoring networks. The code assembles a harmonised database from Sentinel-5P
  TROPOMI NO2 columns, MERRA-2 meteorology, Global Human Settlement Layer urban
  morphology and ground observations; fits a climate-gated two-stage
  gradient-boosted model under a validation protocol fixed before modelling;
  and produces surface NO2 estimates for 100 cities with two independent
  confidence measures.
